## Visual style (locked)

**MeWorld sculptural CGI** on **every** panel — hospital and desert/metaphor in the **same** render family. Match uber GAME-SCENE gold (AO, soft GI, muted clinical grade). **NOT** photoreal documentary, **NOT** stock photo, **NOT** line art.

Thin black dividers · no text labels · no watermark.

## Narrative framing (clinical storyboards)

When a beat involves family conflict (e.g. gestational hypertension / immune metaphor):

- **Subtext over direct statement** — Immersa voice standard
- Relative anger points at **fear**, not moral judgment of the patient's past
- Example (Case 090): son is not mad she had other partners; he is scared because he has watched her body do this fourteen times and does not know how to stop fearing the fifteenth

